DTSTART:20261015T180000Z
DTEND:20261015T200000Z
DESCRIPTION:🎬 Show Her the Money: Film Screening & Fireside Chat\n\n \n\n📅 Thursday\, October 15\, 2026\n🕑 Film Screening: 2:00 PM | Fireside Chat: 3:30 PM\n🚪 Doors Open: 1:45 PM\n📍 FSU ASLC Building | 942 Learning Way\, Tallahassee\, FL\n\n \n\nBig ideas deserve big opportunities—and women entrepreneurs deserve a seat at the table.\n\nJoin us for a special screening of Show Her the Money\, an award-winning documentary that pulls back the curtain on the world of venture capital and shines a spotlight on the women working to change the game.\n\nNamed by U.S. News & World Report as one of the top financial films of the decade\, Show Her the Money has been screened in more than 100 cities worldwide—and now it's coming to FSU!\n\nFollowing the screening\, stick around for an engaging fireside chat featuring Catherine Gray\, Executive Producer of Show Her the Money\, moderated by Lesley Robinson of Embolden Education.\n\n \n\n🎬 Watch an award-winning documentary exploring women\, entrepreneurship\, and venture capital\n💡 Discover the challenges and opportunities facing women seeking investment\n🎤 Hear directly from the film's executive producer during a special fireside chat\n🤝 Connect with a conversation about innovation\, investment\, and creating opportunities for women entrepreneurs\n\n \n\nWhether you're an aspiring entrepreneur\, interested in investing\, or simply passionate about breaking barriers\, this is a conversation you won't want to miss!\n\n \n\nCome for the film. Stay for the conversation. Leave inspired to change the game.
GEO:30.440947;-84.299528
LOCATION:Askew Student Life Center\, Theater
SUMMARY:Show Her the Money Film Screening & Fireside Chat
URL;VALUE=URI:https://calendar.fsu.edu/event/show-her-the-money-film-screening-fireside-chat
CATEGORIES:Arts/Entertainment
CATEGORIES:Film Screening
CATEGORIES:Academic/Registrar
CATEGORIES:Panel
END:VEVENT
