DESCRIPTION:I see you shiver with antici… pation! The Rocky Horror Picture Show is making its annual return to the Askew Student Life Center! Brad and Janet\, a newlywed couple\, pop a tire and get stranded on the road in the middle of a dark and stormy night. With nowhere else to turn\, the couple stumbles into the manor of Dr. Frank-N-Furter. The events that ensue can only be described as fabulous and jaw-dropping. Even better\, we celebrate the Rocky Horror Tradition with pre-show games and a live cast of actors from White Mouse Productions bringing the film to life in real time!\n\nJoin us on Thursday for a Sensory Friendly screening with no callouts\, shadowcast or props!\nJoin us on Friday and Saturday for the FULL Rocky Horror Experience!\n---\nEvent Details: https://hq.fsu.edu/rsvp?id=377752
GEO:30.440947;-84.299528
LOCATION:Askew Student Life Center
SUMMARY:The Rocky Horror Picture Show
URL;VALUE=URI:https://calendar.fsu.edu/event/the-rocky-horror-picture-show-2777
END:VEVENT
