UID:tag:localist.com\,2008:EventInstance_54201811164855
DTSTART:20261022T220000Z
DTEND:20261023T010000Z
DESCRIPTION:You’re not supposed to be here…\nAfter discovering a mysterious doorway in the basement of his furniture store\, Clark takes it upon himself to explore the endless maze of liminal rooms and hallways\, unknowingly straying himself further and further away from reality.\nEnter the liminal world of the horror phenomenon with the ASLC’s very special screening of Backrooms.\n---\nEvent Details: https://hq.fsu.edu/rsvp?id=377500
GEO:30.440947;-84.299528
LOCATION:Askew Student Life Center
SUMMARY:Backrooms (2026) Screening
URL;VALUE=URI:https://calendar.fsu.edu/event/backrooms-2026-screening
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTAMP:20261015T235618Z
UID:tag:localist.com\,2008:EventInstance_54097793724913
DTSTART:20261119T200000Z
DTEND:20261119T220000Z
DESCRIPTION:The College of Social Sciences and Public Policy (COSSPP) presents a Mark and Marianne Barnebey Leadership Lecture Series talk with The Honorable Larry Hogan\, on Thursday\, November 19\, at 3 p.m.\, with a reception following at 4 p.m. in the ASLC Theatre Lobby.\n\nLarry Hogan is a two-term former governor of Maryland and a proud FSU graduate. He earned his bachelor’s degree in political science from FSU in 1978\, where his interest in government\, public service and problem solving helped shape a career defined by leadership in both the private sector and public life. Hogan was elected governor of Maryland in 2014 and was reelected in 2018. During his two terms\, he focused on economic development\, fiscal management\, infrastructure and crisis response. In 2019\, he was elected as chairman of the National Governors Association\, where he launched an initiative on infrastructure and represented governors from across the country.Hogan left office in 2023 after serving two terms. His career in public service reflects a longstanding focus on bipartisan collaboration\, strategic communication and solving complex challenges.
GEO:30.440947;-84.299528
LOCATION:Askew Student Life Center\, Askew Student Life Center Theatre
SUMMARY:COSSPP Barnebey Lecture Series with The Honorable Larry Hogan
URL;VALUE=URI:https://calendar.fsu.edu/event/fall-2026-barnedbey-lecture-series-larry-hogan
CATEGORIES:Lecture
END:VEVENT
